{"id":"n71483-4-5","stage":1,"title":"팔리다 · 分散","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71483-4-5-1","ko":"곧 시험인데 그렇게 게임에 정신 팔려서 어떡하니?","zh":"马上就要考试了，还这么沉迷游戏，要怎么办啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"곧","meaning":"就，马上，即将","explanation":"곧：就，马上，即将","readings":[{"term":"곧","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26802","senseId":"2","lemma":"곧","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시험인데","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"“그러하게(那样，那么)”的缩略语。","explanation":"그렇게：“그러하게(那样，那么)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36292","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게임에","meaning":"游戏，比赛","explanation":"게임：游戏，比赛；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"게임","audio":"/audio/252ac990d27ebe080959.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57276","senseId":"1","lemma":"게임","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정신","meaning":"精神，意识","explanation":"정신：精神，意识","readings":[{"term":"정신","audio":"/audio/2c3d6b050d278eb5e5ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75789","senseId":"3","lemma":"정신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"팔려서","meaning":"分散，开小差","explanation":"팔리다：分散，开小差；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"팔리다","audio":"/audio/5f104909fa8ff0fa0801.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71483","senseId":"4","lemma":"팔리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떡하니?","meaning":"“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。","explanation":"어떡하다：“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"어떡하다","audio":"/audio/e39300a264725a21172c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70480","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떡하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c2f53c24d7797085","term":"곧","zh":"就，马上，即将","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3","entryId":"26802","definition":"时间没过多久。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"ff65dc582ce71198","term":"시험","zh":"考试","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3","entryId":"20233","definition":"按照问题、提问、实际行动等一定程序考核考生的知识或能力的事宜。","pronunciation":["시험"]},{"id":"b470a873a66143d2","term":"그렇게","zh":"“그러하게(那样，那么)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3","entryId":"36292","definition":"“그러하게(那样，那么)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"252ac990d27ebe08","term":"게임","zh":"游戏，比赛","audio":"/audio/252ac990d27ebe080959.mp3","entryId":"57276","definition":"制定规则、分出胜负的玩法。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"2c3d6b050d278eb5","term":"정신","zh":"精神，意识","audio":"/audio/2c3d6b050d278eb5e5ed.mp3","entryId":"75789","definition":"心态。","pronunciation":["정신"]},{"id":"5f104909fa8ff0fa","term":"팔리다","zh":"分散，开小差","audio":"/audio/5f104909fa8ff0fa0801.mp3","entryId":"71483","definition":"注意力被放在别处，而没被放在该放的地方。","pronunciation":["팔리다"]},{"id":"e39300a264725a21","term":"어떡하다","zh":"“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/e39300a264725a21172c.mp3","entryId":"70480","definition":"“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]}],"audio":"/audio/079481b34f4c79c2478e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71483-4-5-2","ko":"내 일은 내가 알아서 할게.","zh":"我的事我自己会处理的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일은","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","sen